{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26864","headline":"杭州观潮 · 姚合","name":"杭州观潮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼有章亭号，涛来自古今。\n势连苍海阔，色比白云深。\n怒雪驱寒气，狂雷散大音。\n浪高风更起，波急石难沈。\n鸟惧多遥过，龙惊不敢吟。\n坳如开玉穴，危似走琼岑。\n但褫千人魄，那知伍相心。\n岸摧连古道，洲涨碚丛林。\n跳沫山皆湿，当江日半阴。\n天然与禹凿，此理遣谁寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26864.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26864","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}